  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "1. Save mirror settings. Currently if you restart the game the settings like size, transparency, border, etc. will reset.\n2. Add mirror presets. This would be a feature to allow you to quickly swap between different mirror settings, as well as quickly load your mirror settings in case you accidentally hit the \"Reset\" button for the mirror.\n3. Have the mirror spawn in front of your your face instead of your hips (or add an option to do this). I primarily use the mirror to see my character's face on a small size. It would be a great improvement for me to be able to simple toggle the mirror off and on to put it back in front of my face. Alternatively add X,Y,Z offsets so you can have it spawn wherever you want.\n4. Add a configurable distance setting the mirror will spawn at. (or add X,Y,Z offset option as above)\n5. Add the ability to rotate the mirror clockwise/counterclockwise when you are grabbing it. I'm not always completely level with the ground so this would help during these instances.\n6. Add mirror controls to the wings of the quick menu. This will allow you another way to access the mirror options, as using the radial menu can be inconvenient sometimes, if for example you are in your avatar's options, you currently need to now back all the way out the the top level of the radial menu, enter the mirror options and change what you need (toggling the mirror on and off and locking/unlocking the mirror are things I want to do regularly) then go back into your avatar options so you can control a part of your avatar (say tail or ear movement).",
